<div class="page">

  <div class="header">
    <div class="title1">去过<span class="big">6次</span><span class="big" style="color:#111;">重庆</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;深度解锁千里江山</div>
  </div>
  <div class="banner-blue">3D魔幻网红打卡+小众人文建筑+地道小吃</div>

  <table class="main">
    <tr>
      <th class="col-time">时间</th>
      <th>线路</th>
      <th class="col-eat">吃</th>
    </tr>

